cmu-humanoid-profile-editor-foxtrot-squad-label = Opt into the FOB security squad (Foxtrot / Victor):
cmu-humanoid-profile-editor-foxtrot-squad-description = Foxtrot (GOVFOR) and Victor (OPFOR) are the security squads: they build up and secure the FOB. Each has its own five slots on top of the regular ones - 1 Squad Leader, 1 Radio Traffic Operator and 3 Combat Technicians - and joining as one of these puts you in it while it has room for your role. Its Squad Leader and RTO get Combat Technician construction and engineering skills, and its Combat Technicians get 15 extra vendor points.
cmu-humanoid-profile-editor-foxtrot-squad-tooltip = Only affects Squad Leader, Radio Traffic Operator and Combat Technician. If its slot for your role is taken, you join a regular squad as normal.

cmu-foxtrot-squad-confirm-title = Reserved for {$squad}
cmu-foxtrot-squad-confirm-prompt = The only {$job} slot left is reserved for {$squad}, the security squad that builds and secures the FOB.
cmu-foxtrot-squad-confirm-join = Join {$squad}
cmu-foxtrot-squad-confirm-join-desc = Are you sure you'd like to join the {$squad} squad as {$job}?
cmu-foxtrot-squad-confirm-cancel = Stay in the lobby
cmu-foxtrot-squad-confirm-cancel-desc = Pick another role instead.

cmu-foxtrot-squad-only-slot-assigned = The regular squads had no slot left for your role, so you were placed in the {$squad} squad.
